  "reference": "Rumi 13",
  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mureeda aba heeda fuga ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daba siisi sissa mureeda fuga ambaliischi. Aba gideaba manda sugoocheanduumeeda maleapna heeda ASEETA, ak eara giika midean earaga ghwayiin ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwasunu eara aba siida shaang' fuga ambaliischi siisi gang'uchi sea ng'asheanda guh ASEETA, nea fuga shaang' gay ghwanyas ghoorjooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba sugoodiga iissa ea mwanung' ghabeal fuga miyaas, iissa ghwanung' ghabeal fuga sina ng'asheega munyas. Asi gigasayi eamiiwali fuga ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida? Sina ng'asheega miyaas, ak abeeda gay ghaghwarnyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba niny soomjeanda ASEETA gil aba badaydaang'u. Ama iisini ng'asheega munyas, gishageadi, aba gideaba niny meata ng'uta mwadaagha; aba gideaba niny soomjeanda ASEETA jea ghwalas aba nyarasta siida sina ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghang'wana gwasin siida mureeda, ak ea adisini aba mulsiinda nyarasta ASEETA ak ghwahit, sina aba gidida apkaata uhuudaang'uuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba sareani gootayiidi gwaadi, aba gideaba fuga ambaliischi fuga gadiyeeda bea ASEETA, nea ghoashng'u aba jeedeaba gadiyeeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oatawa buuneesean haleanjeeda doobiiwsa, siida gwaadi adawa gwaadi, nea siida gujaweeda adawa gujaweeda, siida haguuw gideaba gajeawal gheang'da deatawa gheawalmeeda, nea siida haguuw mureeda deatawa mureeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daba siisi gadiyeesa nuut",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gindeawi siileeda siida wassean, anung'waada eaghus bariinyeegeaba geat, aba gideaba siida bwariiy giischeewoocheandaanyi niing'waay deaweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Digheanyeeka ayi, “Adimealuuli, Adinuusi siida, Adijagwadiischi, Adishisi ghaang' gissiida,” ghana gwanda diigheanuut wassean, geekuuyeasa jeedeaba ng'asheanji, bea gideaba, “Bwariiyda gischeewoocheandaang'u gidubwariiydi geaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega moamu gwasissa giischeewoocheanda ng'asheanda muy, asi bariinyeega giimajeekta deaweeda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iisinali gideaba nihita damanda jea eang'eatng'eadana jeeda ruweanga. Aba gideaba ghamneawa lealeanoodeanya ea neekeewaneasa muuchi ea ea mawuurji damanda ghayi simwaseawi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eaweeda nigeawiit muuchi, askwearda ea nineekiit. Asi eehista gadiyoojiga misaneeda ak geashaash dabita weeshinda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi eara aseasa gagasa eabeada fuga mida heedeesh, mii geawunda gheang'da gil ea booktuumeeda, mii ng'asheega munyas gil ea hiseadayeanduumeeda, mii jaliida gil ea lajoodeaba ghuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ookweala Ng'utamiida was Yesu Gristo, nea adoong'ulayi ng'asheega saseeda ghana asina gidagasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
